    "updated_at": "2015-08-28T18:04:34Z",
    "body": "This would notably allow authors to pass in object literals, e.g. `{ left: 0, top: 10, bottom: 20, right: 30 }`, instead of having to create new `DOMMatrix` instances. It's generally good practice to allow dictionary inputs in cases like these, and is the reason `DOMMatrixInit` was invented.\n",
